  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nDecoding symbols:\n\n \n \n\n **Letter**\n A\n B\n C\n D\n \n \n\n Stands For\n ÷\n ×\n +\n –\n \n \n\n**Required resultant: **218\n\nSo, checking each option one by one\n\nOption 1) 32 B 8 D 160 A 2 C 42 ⇒ 32 × 8 – 160 ÷ 2 + 42\n\n⇒ 32 × 8 – __**160 **____**÷**____** 2**__ + 42\n\n⇒ __**32 ×**____** 8**__ – 80 + 42\n\n⇒ __**256**____** + 42**__ – 80\n\n⇒ __**298 - 80**__\n\n**⇒ 218**\n\nOption 2) 32 A 8 D 160 B 2 C 42 ⇒ 32 ÷ 8 – 160 × 2 + 42\n\n⇒ __**32 ÷**____** 8**__ – 160 × 2 + 42\n\n⇒ 4 – __**160 **____**×**____** 2**__ + 42\n\n⇒ __**4**____** + 42**__ – 320\n\n⇒ __**46 - 320**__\n\n⇒ -274\n\nOption 3) 32 B 8 D 160 C 2 A 42 ⇒ 32 × 8 – 160 + 2 ÷ 42\n\n⇒ 32 × 8 – 160 + __**2 **____**÷ 42**__\n\n⇒ __**32 ×**____** 8**__ – 160 + 0.04\n\n⇒ __**256 +0.04**__ - 160\n\n⇒ __**256.04 - 160**__\n\n⇒ 196.04\n\nOption 4) 32 C 8 D 160 A 2 B 42 ⇒ 32 + 8 – 160 ÷ 2 × 42\n\n⇒ 32 + 8 – __**160 **____**÷**____** 2**__ × 42\n\n⇒ 32 + 8 – __**80**____** × 42**__\n\n⇒ __**32 + 8**__ – 3360\n\n⇒ __**40 - 3360**__\n\n⇒ -3320\n\nHence, \"Option 1\" is the correct answer.",
